   "date": "2021-10-28",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Financial Services Compensation Scheme of Last Resort Levy Bill 2021 was moved for second reading, establishing a levy framework funded by industry entities through an annual levy starting January 2023, with sub-sector caps of $10 million and an overall cap of $250 million, plus a one-off levy on the ten largest financial sector entities in 2022-23 and provision for special levies in response to unforeseen events."
  }
 ],
